+
+Export `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` from `src/index.ts`, applying a JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386).
+Non-object patches replace the target; object patches merge member by member, null deleting a member;
+inputs are not modified. Tests added in `src/index.test.ts` (RFC 7386 appendix A cases).
